      "id": 3,
      "text": "Emerald Hills used septic tanks until the early 1980s; in 1982 a sewer system was installed, and the neighborhood had 900 homes.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
